# Implementation plan — Spec 1.13.1

## Summary

After WebOnOne login succeeds, before the dashboard loads, show a **Choose account** dialog when the user is Super Admin and/or owns companies. List **Default User** (pre-selected), **Super Admin** (if any), and **each owned company**. Skip the dialog when the user only has Default User. Continue reissues Identity session role. Mid-session All Companies Login from 1.13.0 stays unchanged.

See [02-account-selection-dialog.md](./02-account-selection-dialog.md), [03-assumable-roles-for-selection.md](./03-assumable-roles-for-selection.md).

